{
  "$comment": "Runner thresholds for pnpm perf. threshold = target_ms x runner_factor. The factor and its source are in scripts/perf/README.md Sections 2 and 3. Every criterion benchmark must have one entry here; a benchmark with no entry fails the run. Later plan files only add entries; they never change runner_factor.",
  "runner_factor": 1.0,
  "benches": [
